  "pli-tv-kd4:1.3.1": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Harita</i> could in principle refer to all plants, but it is elsewhere defined as what is cultivated, see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc19/en/brahmali#2.1.14'>Bu Pc 19:2.1.14</a> and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bi-vb-pc9/en/brahmali#2.1.14'>Bi Pc 9:2.1.14</a>. ",
