  "pli-tv-kd4:1.14.6": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Therena bhikkhunā</i> could be rendered “a/the senior monk”. Yet the point is that only the most senior member of the Sangha should use the semi-informal address <i lang='pi' translate='no'>āvuso</i>, whereas everyone else should use the formal equivalent <i lang='pi' translate='no'>bhante</i>. ",
  "pli-tv-kd4:1.14.7": "",
  "pli-tv-kd4:1.14.8": "“Correct” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vadantu</i>. See <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vadati</i> in Appendix of Technical Terms. ",
