  "pli-tv-kd4:13.1.48.1": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Nānāsaṁvāsaka</i> (and <i lang='pi' translate='no'>samānasaṁvāsaka</i>) need to be carefully distinguished from <i lang='pi' translate='no'>nānāsaṁvāsa</i> (and <i lang='pi' translate='no'>samānasaṁvāsa</i>). Only the former means “one belonging to a different Buddhist sect”. The latter means “belonging to a different community”, as decided by <i lang='pi' translate='no'>sīmās</i>. ",
