  "pli-tv-kd4:13.1.68": "Here and below I understand a monastery, an <i lang='pi' translate='no'>āvāsa</i>, to refer to a monastery with a properly defined zone, a <i lang='pi' translate='no'>sīmā</i>. A non-monastery, an <i lang='pi' translate='no'>anāvāsa</i>, is then a monastic residence without such a zone. ",
